{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297080","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1029708001:1":{"text":"こっちの準備はもう終わったぞ。商隊の馬車と護衛も手配したし、試験販売用の荷物も少し用意しておいた。","source_cn":"我这边行李已经收拾完了，商队需要的马车和护卫也都置办完...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA59F2E8D3443CD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1029708001":{"text":"こっちの準備はもう終わったぞ。商隊の馬車と護衛も手配したし、試験販売用の荷物も少し用意しておいた。","source_cn":"我这边行李已经收拾完了，商队需要的马车和护卫也都置办完成，还准备了一部分试销的货物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA59F2E8D3443CD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029708002:1":{"text":"ああ。まだ、どんな商品に需要があるか分からないし、砂漠みたいな過酷な環境では、なるべく身軽な方がいいと思ったんだ。","source_cn":"嗯，一方面是不知道货品销路，另一方面也是听说沙漠比较艰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A5EBA75DFDAFBD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029708003:1":{"text":"それに、護衛の傭兵が言ってたんだ。万が一強盗に出くわしたら、軽い馬車の方が早く逃げられるからって。","source_cn":"而且还有盗匪，如果车子轻便的话，至少逃跑也能快一点吧…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF180EEECE4F3C4C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029708006:1":{"text":"ロワンさんって、計画は野心的なのに、行動はとても慎重なんですね。","source_cn":"罗万的计划野心勃勃，但做事却是小心翼翼的呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC0BDDF98061D9D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","va